<navbar
    title="导入到日历"
    ifSubPage="{{ true }}"
    ifNeedUpdateBtn="{{ false }}"
/>

<view class="title-box">
    <view class="title-text">效果和说明</view>
    <view class="title-desc">实机效果图</view>
</view>

<view class="card main-box">
    <image
        class="main-screenshot"
        mode="widthFix"
        src="/images/screenshot.png"
    />
    <view class="main-content">
        <view>
            <view class="main-content-point">应用适配：</view>
            <view>以上为苹果系统测试效果，原则上只要日历支持导入 iCalendar 数据，那就可以使用这个链接来导入课表到日历中。</view>
        </view>
        <view>
            <view class="main-content-point">提醒服务：</view>
            <view>开启日历提醒后，在当天上午的第一节上课前会闹钟提醒，下午同样是第一节上课前闹钟提醒，若上午或下午没课则无提醒服务。</view>
        </view>
    </view>
</view>

<view class="title-box">
    <view class="title-text">导入操作指南</view>
    <view class="title-desc">以苹果手机自带的日历为例</view>
</view>

<view class="card step-box">
    <t-steps
        readonly
        current='{{ 10 }}'
        layout="vertical"
    >
        <t-step-item
            title="获取订阅链接"
            content="下方“设置”按钮可调整适合个人作息的提醒时间"
            status="process"
            t-class-extra="step-item"
        >
            <view
                slot="extra"
                class="form-box"
            >
                <view class="form-item">
                    <t-button
                        class="form-btn"
                        bind:tap="displayAlarmPicker"
                    >设置</t-button>
                    <t-button
                        class="form-btn"
                        theme="primary"
                        icon="link"
                        bind:tap="copySubUrl"
                    >复制链接</t-button>
                </view>
                <view
                    class="form-item"
                    wx:if="{{ ifCustom[0] }}"
                >
                    <t-input
                        t-class="form-inp"
                        type="number"
                        label="上午"
                        suffix="分钟前"
                        id="tm"
                        bind:change="onCustomChange"
                    />
                </view>
                <view
                    class="form-item"
                    wx:if="{{ ifCustom[1] }}"
                >
                    <t-input
                        t-class="form-inp"
                        type="number"
                        label="下午"
                        suffix="分钟前"
                        id="ta"
                        bind:change="onCustomChange"
                    />
                </view>
            </view>
        </t-step-item>
        <t-step-item
            title="打开日历APP，点击底部的“日历”"
            status="process"
            t-class-extra="step-item"
        >
            <view slot="extra">
                <image
                    class="step-schematic"
                    mode="widthFix"
                    src="/images/steps/1.png"
                />
            </view>
        </t-step-item>
        <t-step-item
            title="点击弹出页面的底部最左边的“添加日历”"
            status="process"
            t-class-extra="step-item"
        >
            <view slot="extra">
                <image
                    class="step-schematic"
                    mode="widthFix"
                    src="/images/steps/2.png"
                />
            </view>
        </t-step-item>
        <t-step-item
            title="选择第二项“添加订阅日历”"
            status="process"
            t-class-extra="step-item"
        >
            <view slot="extra">
                <image
                    class="step-schematic"
                    mode="widthFix"
                    src="/images/steps/3.png"
                />
            </view>
        </t-step-item>
        <t-step-item
            title="粘贴刚才复制的订阅链接，然后“订阅”"
            status="process"
            t-class-extra="step-item"
        >
            <view slot="extra">
                <image
                    class="step-schematic"
                    mode="widthFix"
                    src="/images/steps/4.png"
                />
            </view>
        </t-step-item>
        <t-step-item
            title="滑动到页面底部，点击“订阅详细信息”"
            content="这一步和下面的一步是为了保留提醒服务，而不被移除"
            status="process"
            t-class-extra="step-item"
        >
            <view slot="extra">
                <image
                    class="step-schematic"
                    mode="widthFix"
                    src="/images/steps/5.png"
                />
            </view>
        </t-step-item>
        <t-step-item
            title="“移除提醒”默认是勾选状态，手动取消勾选"
            content="取消勾选后如图所示，即为保留提醒服务"
            status="process"
            t-class-extra="step-item"
        >
            <view slot="extra">
                <image
                    class="step-schematic"
                    mode="widthFix"
                    src="/images/steps/6.png"
                />
            </view>
        </t-step-item>
        <t-step-item
            title="最后，点击上面的“添加”即可"
            status="process"
            t-class-extra="step-item"
        >
            <view slot="extra">
                <image
                    class="step-schematic"
                    mode="widthFix"
                    src="/images/steps/7.png"
                />
            </view>
        </t-step-item>
        <t-step-item
            title="导入完成！"
            content="至此，您已将课表导入到日历当中。"
            status="process"
            t-class-extra="step-item"
        />
        <t-step-item
            title="取消提醒服务（若您不需要）"
            content="在上面第二步进去后，找到并点进课表日历，取消勾选如下图的设置即可"
            status="error"
            t-class-extra="step-item"
        >
            <view slot="extra">
                <image
                    class="step-schematic"
                    mode="widthFix"
                    src="/images/steps/8.png"
                />
            </view>
        </t-step-item>
    </t-steps>
</view>

<t-picker
    visible="{{ pickerVisible }}"
    value="{{ alarmVal }}"
    defaultValue="{{ [ 30 ] }}"
    title="设置提醒时间"
    cancelBtn="取消 "
    confirmBtn="确定"
    usingCustomNavbar
    bind:pick="onAlarmChange"
    bind:close="displayAlarmPicker"
>
    <view
        slot="content"
        style="text-align: center;font-size: var(--td-font-size-base);margin-bottom: 10px"
    >左列为上午提醒时间，右列为下午提醒时间</view>
    <t-picker-item options="{{ alarmOpts }}"></t-picker-item>
    <t-picker-item options="{{ alarmOpts }}"></t-picker-item>
</t-picker>

<t-message id="t-message" />